//
// File: zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_3d_state.zia
// Purpose: Persistent fields and deterministic initialization for the 3D scene editor controller.
// Key invariants:
//   - InitializeState assigns every controller field exactly once before any focused layer is pumped.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - The final SceneEditor3D facade owns this inherited state and all retained UI/runtime handles.
// Links: zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_3d.zia, zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_3d_contract_06.zia
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

